  "content": {
    "id": "p23-q53-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "53",
    "prompt": "Given acute angles $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ such that $\\cos\\alpha=\\frac45$ and $\\sin\\beta=\\frac7{25}$, find the exact values of the following.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p23-q53-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac45$",
          "worked": "Since both angles are acute,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\alpha&=\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac45\\right)^2}=\\frac35,\\\\\\cos\\beta&=\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac7{25}\\right)^2}=\\frac{24}{25}.\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\cos\\alpha\\sin\\beta\\\\\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\frac35\\times\\frac{24}{25}+\\frac45\\times\\frac7{25}\\\\\\sin(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\frac{100}{125}=\\frac45.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q53-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{117}{125}$",
          "worked": "Since both angles are acute,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\alpha&=\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac45\\right)^2}=\\frac35,\\\\\\cos\\beta&=\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\frac7{25}\\right)^2}=\\frac{24}{25}.\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)&=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta\\\\\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)&=\\frac45\\times\\frac{24}{25}+\\frac35\\times\\frac7{25}\\\\\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)&=\\frac{117}{125}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q53-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\tan(\\alpha+\\beta)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac43$",
          "worked": "The acute-angle conditions give $\\sin\\alpha=\\frac35$ and $\\cos\\beta=\\frac{24}{25}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan\\alpha&=\\frac{3/5}{4/5}=\\frac34,\\\\\\tan\\beta&=\\frac{7/25}{24/25}=\\frac7{24}.\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\frac{\\tan\\alpha+\\tan\\beta}{1-\\tan\\alpha\\tan\\beta}\\\\\\tan(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\frac{\\frac34+\\frac7{24}}{1-\\frac34\\times\\frac7{24}}\\\\\\tan(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\frac{25/24}{25/32}\\\\\\tan(\\alpha+\\beta)&=\\frac43.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 78
      }
    ]
  },
